\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par \f13 Each segment can be set to one of{\up K}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up K} Mounting of  Back Scattered Detector}
 three bias states.
\par 
\par \pard\tx355 \tab \b Normal\plain\f13\fs24 \tab The signal is added to the total signal.
\par 
\par \tab \b Off\plain\f13\fs24 \tab \tab The signal is not used.
\par 
\par \tab \b Inverted\plain\f13\fs24 \tab The signal is inverted before being added to the total signal.
\par 
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\} Open the \ul Drop-down List\plain\f13\fs24 {\v XYVXW3@Sem.HLP} and \ul click\plain\f13\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP} on the bias set{\up K}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up K} Registration Algorithm}
ting of your choice.
