\par 
\par The SCM is both an\uldb \b  Imaging\plain\b\fs24 {\v specimen_current_Imaging}\plain\fs24  device and measurement device.
\par 
\par \b Measurement:\plain\fs24 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx6795\cellx10985\cellx13465\pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f13 \{bmc bm8.bmp\}\f4 \tab \ul Click\plain\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP} on \b SCM Measure\plain\fs24  to switch the Specimen Current Monitor to Measurement Mode
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f13 \{bmc bm8.bmp\}\f4 \tab Click on \b Spot\plain\fs24  \{bmc bm3.bmp\} to stop the scan and put the beam on a spot.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f13 \{bmc bm8.bmp\}\f4 \tab \ul Drag\plain\fs24 {\v DRAG@Sem.HLP} the \b Spot \plain\fs24 to the required position.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f13 \{bmc bm8.bmp\}\f4 \tab \b Close\plain\fs24  the window by clicking on \{bmc bm18.bmp\}.\cell\pard \pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 \pard\intbl \{bmc bm44.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl 
